    </span></td>
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
    FDA approved the use of NO as an inhaled drug for the treatment of PPHN in 1999. More than 20 years of clinical experience in the
    delivery, monitoring and understanding of NO in the clinical environment for vascular uses has been documented.</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
