    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">clearance
    or approval of product modifications to 510(k)-cleared devices that could significantly affect safety or effectiveness or that would
    constitute a major change in intended use of one of our cleared devices, or approval of certain modifications to PMA-approved devices;</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
