our failing to obtain certification or regulatory approval to market any of our product candidates, which would significantly harm our
business, results of operations and prospects.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: center"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

